<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車こぐ.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "0" "30"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "900" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "ネジの壊れたロボット.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\桜道夜ブラー.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>How many years has it been since I rode a bicycle this hard, standing on the pedals?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
If <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> really is heading for the police station, then if I go to the police station first and turn from there toward <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>'s house, I should meet her without fail.<PG>
There was still no wind, and the moonlight lit the avenue of cherry trees <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="こうこう">brilliantly</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\警察署外観夜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I reached the police station in 10 minutes. I must have got there before <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> did.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From there I changed direction toward <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>'s house and rode on, watching carefully so as not to pass her.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The lights of a convenience store came into view in the distance.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> will without fail</STYLE> come along this route.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Let me lie in wait in front of this convenience store.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\コンビニ夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車こぐ.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車ブレーキ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Oh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The figure of someone sitting on the bench in front of the store.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A girl with short hair.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There is no mistaking her!
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "51" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I threw the bicycle down and ran over to <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I held the head of <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>, who was looking at me in surprise, against me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No words came out.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Haha... what did you come here for... It's too early for a visit, isn't it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>'s feeble voice―hearing that voice, I drew my body back from <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Swollen and blotched from crying, <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> was not even wearing a coat.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I took off the coat I had on and put it over <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>'s shoulders.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Let's go home, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">. It is going to be all right."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Home, you say, but where to. Even </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> wouldn't want to look at a murderer's face, daughter or not."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Then let's go home to my house."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I put it to her without taking my eyes off <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>'s face, but...<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Are you an idiot? I might end up killing you!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"But..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There seemed no way to keep the conversation going properly any further.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1,000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自動ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\店出入り.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "800" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
I slowly moved away from <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> and went into the convenience store alone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I bought warm drinks for the two of us and went back to the bench.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\コンビニ夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Drink this and calm down, please. It's my thanks for lunch."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I grinned from ear to ear at <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> looked blankly at my face and took the piping-hot bottle.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I sat down beside <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> and warmed both hands, gone cold from the ride, on the bottle.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Why would </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> be a murderer?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A great cloud of white breath came out of <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>'s mouth.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She did not seem to have calmed down yet.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Why didn't you go to the police?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I tried changing the question. Would she answer something?<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I was thinking about how to tell the police. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">And she's still at the police station, isn't she? </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. I mustn't go near </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was she trying to say that <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="ひょうへん">changes utterly</STYLE> on April 8?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I took the bottle <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> was holding and opened the cap for her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Sorry..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With that, <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> put her mouth to the bottle.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"That's hot!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> let out a small yelp.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"That's because I picked the one that looked hottest."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I gave her a small smile.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "WAIT" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> had dropped her head again. She would not readily try to talk.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, go home on your own. You'll catch a cold!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"I am not leaving </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">'s side until morning comes."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Are you an idiot...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> lifted her head a little.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"I am not an idiot! I'm the genius girl, by my own account and everyone else's!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Heh, are you an idiot...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> showed a laughing face for just an instant.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Matching her, I made a smile too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not a grin from ear to ear, only enough to lift the corners of my mouth.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"That's enough, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, we're going!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I stood up and gave <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>'s arm a hard tug.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Idiot, what are you doing!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"You call me an idiot, idiot, far too much! I said I'm the genius girl!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Stop it! Are you an idiot!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> was resisting desperately.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Not to be outdone, I pulled at her arm.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"What sort of murderer are you! Does a dithering coward like this have the courage to kill a person!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>'s backside lifted off the bench, and her shoes scraped along with a rasp.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Idiot! You don't know anything!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> put more force into it, her backside, which had lifted, came back down onto the bench.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"It's because I don't know anything that I'm telling you to talk to me!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I pulled at her arm without giving up.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"And what are you going to do once you know!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"What do you mean, what for: you want to save </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, don't you!? You need my help, don't you!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"But...! Even if I leaned on </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">that's..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Suddenly <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>'s resistance stopped.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Matching her, I let the strength out of my arm too.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"But... I can't go to </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s house. There's nobody home, is there?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"There is. Just as I was leaving the house, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> came home."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was nothing left but to see the lie through.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But, this is a permitted lie. Not a lie for my own sake, a lie for <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>'s sake.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Come on, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I pulled at <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>'s arm once more.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
There was no sign of resistance any more.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... aren't </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> afraid of me? I... </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Natsumi's dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, do you want to kill me?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Th-that's not it! I... I don't want to kill anyone...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Then I'm not afraid. Why would I have to be afraid of </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　Is April 8 the day </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, like a werewolf, </STYLE><STYLE ID="10" RUBY="ひょうへん">changes utterly</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">not how it is, but..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\登山月.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A great moon hanging in the sky―today, <STYLE ID="11" RUBY="しよう">Shiyo</STYLE> 800, April 8, is a full moon.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Somewhere in a Western country a werewolf may be out, but here in Motoki-cho nothing of the sort is happening.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車開始.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
We each got onto our own bicycle.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, please go first."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Why...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Because I have to keep watch so you don't run off."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> started her bicycle off without a word.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
